  "content_html": "<p></p><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiShGaXq1nPg_yk9ryIimLg-ZPzv1k5TOGsFLgCkkZuMnUKhLq_8swRRoPYwWdwcs0Vva-5TzJDxUhuSAVvMgtNpxuVsChV8w6U5z8o0agYs1dtCM51phE3nFn7oAWcfk_PK5DbLDIqFx11BY9zC6kzoHk4GjZ56NRG5punaGBJz4NvNRU68MkTyHsZQc8/s1024/Designer%20-%202024-10-27T173840.642.jpeg\"><img alt=\"ציור של תיבת נוח עמוסת חיות לעייפה\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiShGaXq1nPg_yk9ryIimLg-ZPzv1k5TOGsFLgCkkZuMnUKhLq_8swRRoPYwWdwcs0Vva-5TzJDxUhuSAVvMgtNpxuVsChV8w6U5z8o0agYs1dtCM51phE3nFn7oAWcfk_PK5DbLDIqFx11BY9zC6kzoHk4GjZ56NRG5punaGBJz4NvNRU68MkTyHsZQc8/w320-h320/Designer%20-%202024-10-27T173840.642.jpeg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">סִיפּוּרֵי מִסְפָּרִים</span></h2><p></p><p></p><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מה הקשר בין צמד המספרים: </span><span style=\"color: #990000; font-size: large;\"><b>2-7</b></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מה&nbsp;הקשר בין שלישיית המספרים:</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-size: large;\"><b>30-50-300</b></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מה הקשר בין צמד המספרים:</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-size: large;\"><b>600-601</b></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מה הקשר בין צמד המספרים:</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-size: large;\"><b>40-150</b></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מה הקשר בין שלישיית המספרים:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-size: large;\"><b>7-7-7</b></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מה הקשר בין שלישיית המספרים:</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"color: #990000; font-size: large;\"><b>1-2-3</b></span></span></li></ol><p></p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></span></h2><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 להבה/תבערה<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 קדקוד<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 שם עַם (מהפרשה)<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 לפני השני\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 אויב\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 כוח\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 בבקשה</span></span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h2><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">סיפורי מספרים</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בעלי החיים בתיבה - 7 זוגות מהטהורים, 2 זוגות מהטמאים</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מידות התיבה - 300 אמה אורך, 50 אמה רוחב, 30 אמה גובה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גיל נח - בן 600 בהתחלת המבול, בן 601 בסוף המבול<br /></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ימי השיטפון - 40 ימי גשם, 150 ימי הצפת תהום</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ימי המתנה לפני ובין שילוחי היונה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִסְפּוּר קומות התיבה</span></li></ol><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-align: right; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">אש, ראש, אשור, ראשון, שונא, און, נא</span><br /></span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>"
